      "content": "idk i dont really have time to go to a doctor right now work is just crazy. it probably is just the stress tho right? i mean everyone gets brain fog when they are burnt out. do u think i could just take some extra magnesium or maybe some melatonin to help me sleep better and see if that fixes the confusion?",
