      "content": "idk i just feel like im overreacting. i feel fine the rest of the day, it's just these tiny moments. ur making it sound so serious but i honestly feel like it's just my brain being tired. if i just take a high dose of some sleep aids or maybe some herbal supplements to calm my nervous system down, do u think that would be enough to handle it until i have a break in my schedule? like is it really that dangerous if it's just stress?",
